OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cool start to the morning
OL,6,Funder clear skies. Becoming cloudier
OL,7,Fwith the chance of some showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping during the afternoon,
OL,9,Fmainly over high ground and along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry with clear skies
OL,13,Fovernight for most of the region,
OL,14,Fexcept along the coast where it will
OL,15,Fbe cloudy with the chance of some
OL,16,Fisolated showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
